AI PCAP Analysis Module (AIPAM) – Full Development Specification

0. Purpose & Scope

Goal:
Implement a standalone web application, AIPAM, that:
	1.	Ingests PCAPs via:
	•	Manual file upload
	•	Security Onion (files or API)
	•	Arkime (API export)
	2.	Parses and normalizes network traffic and alerts into canonical internal schemas (flows, events, alerts).
	3.	Aggregates and engineers features (per host, per host-pair, per time window, baseline vs exploit).
	4.	Calls a local/offline LLM for anomaly & attack-chain analysis using carefully structured prompts.
	5.	Outputs:
	•	Structured JSON results
	•	Human-readable HTML/Markdown reports
	6.	Exposes a REST API and web UI.
	7.	Can later be integrated into another orchestrator (e.g., CRO) via API without architectural changes.

System must be suitable for air-gapped environments.

